  <content>
    <section>
      <para>The scatter plot below shows the results of a survey of eighth-grade students who were asked to report the number of hours per week they spend playing video games and the typical number of hours they sleep each night.</para>
      <para>
        <figure>
          <media alt="A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS VIDEO GAME TIME IN HOURS PER WEEK ON THE X-AXIS AND SLEEP TIME IN HOURS PER NIGHT ON THE Y-AXIS. THE LINE DRAWN DECREASES FROM LEFT TO RIGHT.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_03_10_01.jpg"/>
          </media>
        </figure>
      </para>
      <para>Which of the following conclusions can you make looking at the data?</para>
    </section>
  </content>
